<!-- SECTION 2: AUTHENTICATION -->
<h1>2. Authentication</h1>

<h3>Auth Base URL</h3>
<pre>https://gdcxtefbarvnrtvacqln.supabase.co/auth/v1</pre>

<table>
<tr><th>Action</th><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Body</th></tr>
<tr><td>Sign Up</td><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/auth/v1/signup</code></td><td><code>{ "email": "...", "password": "..." }</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Sign In (Email/Password)</td><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password</code></td><td><code>{ "email": "...", "password": "..." }</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Sign Out</td><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/auth/v1/logout</code></td><td>Header: <code>Authorization: Bearer {token}</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Get User</td><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/auth/v1/user</code></td><td>Header: <code>Authorization: Bearer {token}</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Refresh Token</td><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/auth/v1/token?grant_type=refresh_token</code></td><td><code>{ "refresh_token": "..." }</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Reset Password</td><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/auth/v1/recover</code></td><td><code>{ "email": "..." }</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Update Password</td><td><span class="badge put">PUT</span></td><td><code>/auth/v1/user</code></td><td><code>{ "password": "new_password" }</code></td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Required Headers for All Auth Requests</h4>
<pre>{
  "apikey": "{ANON_KEY}",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}</pre>

<h4>After Sign In - Use JWT Token</h4>
<pre>{
  "apikey": "{ANON_KEY}",
  "Authorization": "Bearer {access_token}",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}</pre>

<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- SECTION 3: DATABASE REST API -->
<h1>3. Database REST API (Module-Wise)</h1>

<div class="note">
<strong>PostgREST Pattern:</strong> All database tables follow the same REST pattern:<br><br>
<span class="badge get">GET</span> <code>/rest/v1/{table}?select=*</code> — List / Read<br>
<span class="badge post">POST</span> <code>/rest/v1/{table}</code> — Insert<br>
<span class="badge patch">PATCH</span> <code>/rest/v1/{table}?id=eq.{id}</code> — Update<br>
<span class="badge delete">DELETE</span> <code>/rest/v1/{table}?id=eq.{id}</code> — Delete<br><br>
Add <code>Prefer: return=representation</code> header to get the result back after insert/update.
</div>

<!-- 3a: Children -->
<h2>3a. Children / Campers</h2>
<p><strong>Table:</strong> <code>children</code></p>

<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th><th>Key Filters</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/children?select=*,bunks(*),divisions(*)&company_id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>List all campers with bunk & division details</td><td><code>company_id</code>, <code>season</code>, <code>division_id</code>, <code>bunk_id</code>, <code>session</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/children?id=eq.{id}&select=*,bunks(*),divisions(*)</code></td><td>Get single camper profile</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/children</code></td><td>Add new camper</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/children?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Update camper info</td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/children?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Delete camper</td><td></td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Key Columns</h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Column</th><th>Type</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
<tr><td>id</td><td>UUID (PK)</td><td>Auto-generated</td></tr>
<tr><td>name</td><td>text</td><td>Required</td></tr>
<tr><td>person_id</td><td>text</td><td>Required - external ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>company_id</td><td>UUID (FK)</td><td>References companies</td></tr>
<tr><td>division_id</td><td>UUID (FK)</td><td>References divisions</td></tr>
<tr><td>bunk_id</td><td>UUID (FK)</td><td>References bunks</td></tr>
<tr><td>leader_id</td><td>UUID (FK)</td><td>References staff</td></tr>
<tr><td>age, gender, grade</td><td>various</td><td>Optional demographics</td></tr>
<tr><td>date_of_birth</td><td>date</td><td>Optional</td></tr>
<tr><td>allergies, medical_notes</td><td>text</td><td>Health info</td></tr>
<tr><td>guardian_name, guardian_email, guardian_phone</td><td>text</td><td>Parent/guardian contact</td></tr>
<tr><td>photo_url</td><td>text</td><td>Profile photo storage path</td></tr>
<tr><td>rfid</td><td>text</td><td>RFID tag identifier</td></tr>
<tr><td>season, session</td><td>text</td><td>Camp season/session</td></tr>
<tr><td>status</td><td>text</td><td>Active/inactive</td></tr>
<tr><td>birthday_*</td><td>various</td><td>Birthday party preferences</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- 3b: Staff -->
<h2>3b. Staff</h2>
<p><strong>Table:</strong> <code>staff</code></p>

<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/staff?select=*,divisions(*)&company_id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>List all staff</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/staff?id=eq.{id}&select=*</code></td><td>Get single staff</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/staff</code></td><td>Add staff member</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/staff?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Update staff</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/staff?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Delete staff</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- 3c: Bunks & Divisions -->
<h2>3c. Bunks &amp; Divisions</h2>

<h4>Table: <code>bunks</code></h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/bunks?select=*,divisions(*)&company_id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>List all bunks with division</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/bunks</code></td><td>Create bunk</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/bunks?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Update bunk</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/bunks?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Delete bunk</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Table: <code>divisions</code></h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/divisions?select=*&company_id=eq.{id}&is_active=eq.true&order=sort_order</code></td><td>List active divisions</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/divisions</code></td><td>Create division</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/divisions?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Update division</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Table: <code>bunk_staff</code> (Junction)</h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/bunk_staff?select=*,staff(*),bunks(*)&company_id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>List bunk-staff assignments</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/bunk_staff</code></td><td>Assign staff to bunk</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/bunk_staff?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Remove assignment</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- 3d: Daily Notes -->
<h2>3d. Daily Notes</h2>
<p><strong>Table:</strong> <code>daily_notes</code></p>

<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/daily_notes?select=*,children(name)&company_id=eq.{id}&date=eq.{date}</code></td><td>Get notes for a specific date</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/daily_notes</code></td><td>Create daily note</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/daily_notes?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Update note</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/daily_notes?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Delete note</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- 3e: Messages & Notifications -->
<h2>3e. Messages &amp; Notifications (Inbox)</h2>
<p><strong>Table:</strong> <code>messages</code></p>

<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/messages?select=*&recipient_id=eq.{user_id}&order=created_at.desc</code></td><td>Get inbox messages</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/messages?select=*&sender_id=eq.{user_id}&notification_type=eq.direct&order=created_at.desc</code></td><td>Get sent messages</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/messages?select=*&parent_message_id=eq.{msg_id}&order=created_at.asc</code></td><td>Get thread replies</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/messages</code></td><td>Send message / reply</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge patch">PATCH</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/messages?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Mark as read: <code>{ "read": true }</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/messages?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Delete message</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Key Columns</h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Column</th><th>Type</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
<tr><td>recipient_id</td><td>UUID</td><td>Recipient user ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>sender_id</td><td>UUID</td><td>Sender user ID</td></tr>
<tr><td>subject</td><td>text</td><td>Message subject</td></tr>
<tr><td>content</td><td>text</td><td>Message body</td></tr>
<tr><td>read</td><td>boolean</td><td>Read status</td></tr>
<tr><td>notification_type</td><td>text</td><td>'direct', 'notification', 'group_alert'</td></tr>
<tr><td>parent_message_id</td><td>UUID</td><td>For threading/replies</td></tr>
<tr><td>group_id</td><td>UUID</td><td>Reference to message_groups for linking</td></tr>
</table>

<!-- 3f: Group Messaging -->
<h2>3f. Group Messaging</h2>

<h4>Table: <code>message_groups</code></h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/message_groups?select=*,group_members!inner(user_id)&group_members.user_id=eq.{user_id}</code></td><td>Get groups user belongs to</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/message_groups</code></td><td>Create group</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Table: <code>group_members</code></h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/group_members?select=*,profiles(*)&group_id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Get group members</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/group_members</code></td><td>Add member to group</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge delete">DELETE</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/group_members?id=eq.{id}</code></td><td>Remove member</td></tr>
</table>

<h4>Table: <code>group_messages</code></h4>
<table>
<tr><th>Method</th><th>Endpoint</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/group_messages?select=*,profiles:sender_id(*)&group_id=eq.{id}&order=created_at.asc</code></td><td>Get messages in group</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge get">GET</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/group_messages?select=*&parent_message_id=eq.{id}&order=created_at.asc</code></td><td>Get thread replies</td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="badge post">POST</span></td><td><code>/rest/v1/group_messages</code></td><td>Send group message</td></tr>
</table>

